<!--
  NightShelf adaptive icon foreground.

  Paths are the master artwork verbatim. The group transform exists because the
  artwork's own centre is (256,289) — it sits low on the 512 canvas — and at
  full size it overflows the centre 72dp of the 108dp viewport that Android
  guarantees to be visible. Scaling to 0.78 about that centre and lifting it
  onto (256,256) keeps the whole silhouette, including the book's lower point,
  inside every launcher mask.
-->
